Title: Neon Courier - Episode 3 "Ledger"

INT. SAFEHOUSE - NIGHT

Mira, red scarf around her neck, plugs the datachip into a cracked terminal. Kai watches over her shoulder.

MIRA
This is Voss's ledger. Every bribe. Every cop on his payroll.

KAI
Then we burn him with it.

INT. VOSS TOWER - HOLDING CELL - LATER

Mira and Kai break in. ROOK (Voss's enforcer, chrome arm) guards Juno. Mira takes Rook down, and he falls from the ledge, dead.

Before he dies, Rook laughs.

ROOK
You'll never touch Voss. Not while his daughter lives.

Mira frees Juno. The sisters embrace.

JUNO
You came.

INT. VOSS TOWER - PENTHOUSE - CONTINUOUS

Voss stares at a framed photo of a young girl.

VOSS
They'll never find you, Elena.

SMASH TO BLACK.
